api_contract_examples:
Examples (illustrative):
1) Successful page issuance:
HTTP/1.1 200 OK
Content-Type: application/json
X-Iterator-Lease: eyJpZCI6IjEyMzQiLCJzdCI6MCwiZXhwIjoxNjg5ODUwMDAwLCJ2IjoiMSJ9
{
  "items": [...],
  "next_token": "eyJpZCI6IjEyMzQiLCJzdCI6MTAwLCJleHAiOjE2ODk4NTAwMDAsInYiOiIxIn0="
}

2) Lease expired when client uses token later:
HTTP/1.1 410 Gone
Content-Type: application/json
{
  "error": {
    "code": "iterator.expired",
    "message": "Iterator lease expired; request a fresh iterator or use migration endpoint."
  }
}

3) Rate limit normalized:
HTTP/1.1 429 Too Many Requests
Retry-After: 12
Content-Type: application/json
{
  "error": {
    "code": "rate.limit",
    "quota": "tokens_per_minute",
    "message": "Rate limit exceeded"
  }
}

4) Gateway migration hint for legacy cursor:
HTTP/1.1 200 OK
X-Embed-Compat: migrate-needed; reason=token-format
{ "items": [...], "legacy_cursor": "abc123" }
